build host/obj/third_party/zlib/zlib_inflate_chunk_simd.stamp: host_stamp host/obj/third_party/zlib/zlib_inflate_chunk_simd/inffast_chunk.o host/obj/third_party/zlib/zlib_inflate_chunk_simd/inflate.o || host/obj/third_party/zlib/zlib_common_headers.stamp
